{
  "_comment": "The battery manifest: what each platform's gate battery runs, as files on disk. verify_rules.py resolves every rule's [check: ...] tag against this file and the files it names, so a rule can never name a check nothing runs. The design is enforcement/README.md section 4.1; this file is the machine-readable side of it. Paths are relative to the repo root. A path listed here that does not exist yet is a gap the verifier reports, never a claim it believes.",
